+// Off-axis stereo for a COMBINED viewing*projection matrix. N64 ports feed
+// Fast3D the combined matrix in G_MTX_PROJECTION (the modelview stack is
+// world space), so a naive eye translation cannot be injected and the camera
+// axes cannot be recovered from the matrix either -- the GAME exports its
+// basis instead (overlay 0032, from BK's viewport_update).
+//   Camera shift:      world translation by -e*right, folded into the matrix.
+//   Convergence skew:  clip_x += s*view_z, with view_z = dot(v,fwd) -
+//                      dot(eye,fwd) and s = e*P00/C, so parallax is exactly
+//                      zero at the focus distance C.
+//   Perspective detect: the combined matrix's w-column top-3 is (+/-)forward
+//                      and therefore unit length; an orthographic matrix has
+//                      (0,0,0) there. HUD and 2D passes thus stay perfectly
+//                      on the panel plane with no special-casing.
